# ⭐ AETHERIA — STAR UP & HERO SYNTHESIS SYSTEM

> **A Hero's growth is not always achieved through battle.**
>
> Sometimes, a Hero must surpass their own limits.
>
> The **Star Up System** allows Heroes to increase their Star Rank and unlock new growth potential.
>
> Higher Star Rank unlocks the **Hero Synthesis System**, allowing the Master to sacrifice other Heroes as growth material to rapidly increase the Level of a selected Hero.
>
> Hero Level dapat ditingkatkan dengan dua cara utama:
>
> 1. Menggunakan **Gold** melalui Level Up biasa.
> 2. Menggunakan **Hero Synthesis** untuk meningkatkan Level dengan cepat melalui pengorbanan Hero lain.
>
> Namun, Heroes are not emotionless resources.
>
> The loss of another Hero can affect the mental and emotional state of surviving Heroes.

---

