ID SYSTEM
DATABASE SYSTEM
GAME STATE SYSTEM
AI CHARACTER SYSTEM
EMOTIONAL SYSTEM
RELATIONSHIP SYSTEM
SYSTEM QUEST
SYSTEM DUNGEON
EVENT SYSTEM
AI FAIRY
