# 51. STAR 7

Star 7 merupakan salah satu tingkat perkembangan tertinggi.

```text
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
        ↓
SYSTEM QUEST
        ↓
SYSTEM DUNGEON
        ↓
SPECIAL CONDITION
        ↓
⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
```

Star 7 tidak tersedia melalui Star Up normal.

Untuk naik ke Star 7, Hero wajib:

```text
Reach Star 6
Complete Required System Quest
Complete Required System Dungeon
Meet Special Condition
Pass Star 7 Validation
```

System Quest dapat menguji:

```text
Hero Story
Character Development
Relationship Condition
Combat Objective
Special Decision
Master Progression
```

System Dungeon dapat menguji:

```text
Combat Strength
Party Composition
Dungeon Floor
Boss Battle
Survival Condition
Special Dungeon Rule
```

Keduanya harus tercatat sebagai completed di Database.

